></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you continue playing, you’ll unlock a variety of adorable decorations and functional buildings: wooden fences, flower beds, water wells — everything you need! Drag and drop things anywhere you like to create the farm of your dreams. Watching your custom farm come to life is endlessly satisfying. And as the map expands, you’ll uncover ancient ruins, uniquely themed regions, and more surprises just waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659410/extras/1f7be135697ebcb7a5778cbaa99edf99.poster.avif?t=1771686980\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659410/extras/1f7be135697ebcb7a5778cbaa99edf99.webm?t=1771686980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659410/extras/1f7be135697ebcb7a5778cbaa99edf99.mp4?t=1771686980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
